%% Workflow D: public queue display with ETag polling
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor V as Visitor / waiting-room TV
  participant FE as Next.js /public/queue/[id]
  participant RP as Reverse proxy
  participant API as Spring Boot API (public controller)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  V->>FE: Open /public/queue/{sid}
  FE->>RP: GET /api/v1/public/queue-sessions/{sid}
  RP->>API: forward (rate limit 120/min/IP)
  API->>DB: read-only tx: session row + WAITING/SERVING numbers + counts
  API-->>FE: 200 PublicQueueStatus, ETag W/"sid-41"
  FE-->>V: NOW SERVING 6 - waiting 7, 8, 9
  loop every NEXT_PUBLIC_QUEUE_POLL_INTERVAL_MS (5 s)
    FE->>API: GET ... If-None-Match: W/"sid-41"
    API->>DB: SELECT version FROM queue_sessions WHERE id = sid
    alt version unchanged
      API-->>FE: 304 Not Modified (no body)
    else queue changed (booking, call, skip ...)
      API->>DB: build PublicQueueStatus
      API-->>FE: 200 PublicQueueStatus, ETag W/"sid-42"
      FE-->>V: animate new number, aria-live announcement
    end
  end
  Note over FE: 3 consecutive failures -> "Connection lost - showing last update at 10:42" banner, keeps retrying
  Note over API: Response DTO has only numbers, counts, status, label - never names, phones, patient numbers or clinical data
